printing.limit = Prente adwuma no aboro ɔhye no: mfonini 200, piksel ɔpepem 40 / piksel 32768 wɔ mfonini biara nkyɛn biara, anaa PDF data a wɔatew ne kɛse 256 MiB.
printing.profile_error = Mfonini yi kɔla profael no nyɛ papa, ɛne no nhyia anaa wɔmmoa no. CMYK/Lab a ɛyɛ ne de ankasa hia profael pa a wɔde ahyɛ mu; RGB hia RGB profael.
printing.does_not_fit = Mfonini no, sɛnea ne krataa DPI te no, nkɔ adaka yi mu. Fa nea ɛhyɛ mu no di dwuma, tew adaka dodow wɔ grid no mu, anaa fa krataa kɛse di dwuma.
printing.caption_limit = Mfonini ho nsɛm no ware dodo ma grid yi. Tew ahama anaa atenten dodow, twa nsɛm no tia, anaa dum mfonini ho nsɛm no.
printing.font_error = Font biara nni hɔ mma mfonini ho nsɛm no. Hyɛ nkyerɛwde font bi anaa dum nsɛm no.
printing.no_document = Bue krataa anaa paw mfonini fi gallery no mu ansa na woaprente.
printing.source_error = Wɔantumi ankan mfonini a wɔapaw, fael a ɛka ho a wɔasesa, anaa mfonini ho nsɛm. Wɔankora PDF biara so.
printing.save_error = Wɔantumi ankora PDF no so. Paw fael din foforo wɔ folda a wobɛtumi akyerɛw mu; wɔmmfa foforo nsi fael a ɛwɔ hɔ dedaw ananmu da.
